      "releaseNotes": "Your Argos app just got a boost! Stay updated on Marketplace orders with in-app status and return tracking, and share your wishlist easily through compatible apps. We’ve also introduced a new recommendation module on your homepage and enhanced order details with clearer expected dates for pre-orders and collections. Plus, we’ve improved the readability of basket errors and fixed several bugs for a steadier shop.",
